Description: portable C code
 - use a regular main() and exit() from the C library instead of the
   _start entry point with x86 inline assembly and the raw x86 syscalls of
   sys.h, so the demo builds on every architecture and with the standard
   start files (PIE, hardening);
 - call gtk_init() with argc/argv, so the GTK options work;
 - always check the shader compilation and link status and print the log
   on stderr (the checks were only built in debug mode, and a driver
   without GLSL 4.20 showed a black screen without any message);
 - drop the unused GLU and GLX includes.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
